      "body": "[\u70b9\u51fb\u9605\u8bfb](https://hellogithub.com/periodical/volume/110) You can read the full article and explore these projects in more detail by clicking [here](https://hellogithub.com/en/periodical/volume/110).\r\n\r\n---\r\nHere's a look at the highlighted projects from this issue, presented in both Chinese and English for your convenience:\r\n\r\n* **\u6e38\u620f\u5f00\u53d1\u5de5\u5177 (Game Development Tools)**\r\n    * **Chroma (C)**: \u80b2\u78a7\u5b98\u65b9\u5f00\u6e90\u7684\u8272\u76f2\u68c0\u6d4b\u5de5\u5177\u3002\r\n        * Ubisoft's official open-source color blindness detection tool.\r\n    * **megacity-metro (C#)**: Unity \u5b98\u65b9\u7684\u5927\u578b\u591a\u4eba\u6e38\u620f\u793a\u4f8b\u3002\r\n        * Unity's official large-scale multiplayer game example.\r\n\r\n* **\u6548\u7387\u5de5\u5177 (Productivity Utilities)**\r\n    * **clawPDF (C#)**: Windows \u865a\u62df\u6253\u5370\u673a\u3002\r\n        * A virtual printer for Windows.\r\n    * **SmartSystemMenu (C#)**: Windows \u7a97\u53e3\u83dc\u5355\u589e\u5f3a\u5de5\u5177\u3002\r\n        * A tool to enhance Windows system window menus.\r\n    * **jarkViewer (C++)**: \u4fbf\u6377\u7684 Windows \u56fe\u7247\u6d4f\u89c8\u5de5\u5177\u3002\r\n        * A convenient image viewer for Windows.\r\n    * **InputSourcePro (Swift)**: macOS \u8f93\u5165\u6cd5\u5207\u6362\u5de5\u5177\u3002\r\n        * A macOS input method switching tool.\r\n\r\n* **Web \u4e0e\u524d\u7aef (Web & Frontend)**\r\n    * **theme.park (CSS)**: \u81ea\u6258\u7ba1\u5e94\u7528\u7684\u4e3b\u9898\u96c6\u5408\u3002\r\n        * A collection of themes for self-hosted applications.\r\n    * **HomePage (JavaScript)**: \u70ab\u9177\u7684\u4e2a\u4eba\u4e3b\u9875\u6a21\u677f\u3002\r\n        * A cool personal homepage template.\r\n    * **uilayouts (JavaScript)**: \u9ad8\u8d28\u91cf React \u52a8\u6548\u7ec4\u4ef6\u5e93\u3002\r\n        * A high-quality React animation component library.\r\n\r\n* **\u540e\u7aef\u4e0e\u670d\u52a1 (Backend & Services)**\r\n    * **monibuca (Go)**: Go \u8bed\u8a00\u6d41\u5a92\u4f53\u670d\u52a1\u5668\u5f00\u53d1\u6846\u67b6\u3002\r\n        * A Go language streaming media server development framework.\r\n    * **server (Go)**: Go \u8bed\u8a00\u5b9e\u73b0\u7684\u901a\u77e5\u63a8\u9001\u5e73\u53f0\u3002\r\n        * A notification push platform implemented in Go.\r\n\r\n* **AI \u4e0e\u673a\u5668\u5b66\u4e60 (AI & Machine Learning)**\r\n    * **LivePortrait**: \u8ba9\u9759\u6001\u7167\u7247\u201c\u6d3b\u201d\u8d77\u6765\u3002\r\n        * Brings static photos to life.\r\n    * **nndeploy**: \u591a\u7aef AI \u63a8\u7406\u90e8\u7f72\u6846\u67b6\u3002\r\n        * A multi-platform AI inference deployment framework.\r\n    * **opik**: \u5f00\u6e90\u7684 LLM \u5e94\u7528\u8bc4\u4f30\u6846\u67b6\u3002\r\n        * An open-source LLM application evaluation framework.\r\n    * **Second-Me**: \u8f7b\u677e\u5b9a\u5236\u4f60\u7684\u672c\u5730 AI \u6570\u5b57\u5206\u8eab\u3002\r\n        * Easily customize your local AI digital twin.\r\n    * **void**: \u5f00\u6e90\u7684 AI \u4ee3\u7801\u7f16\u8f91\u5668\u3002\r\n        * An open-source AI code editor.\r\n\r\n* **\u5b66\u4e60\u8d44\u6e90 (Learning Resources)**\r\n    * **python-mastery (Python)**: \u9ad8\u7ea7 Python \u7f16\u7a0b\u6559\u7a0b\u3002\r\n        * An advanced Python programming tutorial.\r\n    * **Hello-CTF**: \u96f6\u57fa\u7840\u53cb\u597d\u7684 CTF \u6559\u7a0b\u3002\r\n        * A beginner-friendly CTF (Capture The Flag) tutorial.\r\n    * **China-software-copyright**: \u8f6f\u8457\u7533\u8bf7\u6559\u7a0b\u548c\u6a21\u677f\u6587\u4ef6\u3002\r\n        * Software copyright application tutorials and template files.\r\n    * **cs-paper-checklist**: \u8ba1\u7b97\u673a\u79d1\u5b66\u8bba\u6587\u7684\u68c0\u67e5\u6e05\u5355\u3002\r\n        * A checklist for computer science papers.",
